        "description": "The Nintendo Switch App is designed to help enhance your online gameplay experience on Nintendo Switch™ 2 and Nintendo Switch. With this app, you can use friend features and game-specific services even when you're not playing! You can also view and share screenshots and videos uploaded from your console.\n\n◆ Check friends' online status\n\nYou can check whether your friends are online and see what games they're playing. You can also choose to receive a notification in the app when a friend comes online.\n\n◆ Use your smart device to add friends\n\nYou can add friends via their friend code or a QR Code even when you're not using your console.\n\n◆ View your screenshots and videos\n\nYou can upload screenshots and videos saved in your console's album to the app, then view, save and share them.\n\n◆ Game-specific services\n\nYou can access various features designed to enhance your online experience for supported games.\n\nCurrently, game-specific services are available for these games:\n\n　・ The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild – Nintendo Switch 2 Edition and The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom – Nintendo Switch 2 Edition\n　　　・ Receive voice guidance to help you reach locations you haven't visited yet\n　　　・ Share schematics and items via QR Codes\n　　　・ And more!\n\n　・ Splatoon 3\n　　　・ View the online status of friends playing the game\n　　　・ View your battle and Salmon Run stats\n　　　・ View upcoming stage schedules\n　　　・ And more!\n\n　・ Animal Crossing: New Horizons\n　　　・ Send custom designs created in Animal Crossing games on Nintendo 3DS to Animal Crossing: New Horizons\n　　　・ Use your smart device to send messages that appear in-game\n　　　・ View the online status of your Best Friends\n　　　・ And more!\n\n　・ Super Smash Bros. Ultimate\n　　　・ View posted images and videos\n　　　・ Queue downloads of user-created stages to play them in your copy of the game\n　　　・ Receive notifications about upcoming events\n　　　・ And more!\n\n　・ Splatoon 2\n　　　・ Check leaderboards and map schedules\n　　　・ View your battle and Salmon Run stats\n　　　・ And more!\n\nAttention:\n● A Nintendo Switch 2/Nintendo Switch console and supported software are required to use the service.\n● A paid membership to Nintendo Switch Online is required to use some of the features of this app.\n● You must have a Nintendo Account for ages 13 and up in order to use some of this app's features.\n● Permanent internet connection required for use.\n● May contain advertisements and product placement.\n● Please see support.nintendo.com for details about the GameChat feature.\n\nQR Code is a registered trademark of DENSO WAVE INCORPORATED in JAPAN and other countries.",
